  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758564,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - The Living Daylights (Commodore 64) - Synopsis\n\nStep into the shoes of James Bond in *007 - The Living Daylights*, a thrilling platform shooter for the Commodore 64, based on the iconic 1987 film.  Embark on a mission to infiltrate a drug smuggling ring operating out of a Soviet airbase, all while navigating treacherous environments and engaging in intense shootouts.\n\nThe game faithfully recreates key moments from the film, tasking you with traversing horizontally scrolling levels filled with enemy soldiers, KGB agents, and perilous obstacles. Utilize Bond's signature Walther PPK to dispatch foes, and strategically employ gadgets like skiis for daring escapes and grappling hooks to reach new areas. \n\n*The Living Daylights* is notable for its impressive graphics and energetic soundtrack, showcasing the Commodore 64's capabilities.  Experience the tension and excitement of a Bond mission as you strive to uncover the truth and thwart the villain's plans.  A true classic for fans of both James Bond and classic action gaming."
    },
